\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {II}{\ignorespaces Pairwise-distance distribution metrics for generated samples from each model and polymer system. Lower energy and MMD values indicate closer agreement between generated conformations and the training ensemble. Both learned models improve substantially over centered Gaussian samples, with the CNF giving the strongest structural match in these runs.}}{7}{}}
